Subject: [PATCH 131/149] [barreplay] a third toggle word (BARREPLAY_TOGGLES3,
 t3= in park.go); H108: the LOS part of a frame's map-damage craters in one
 pass per sensor type (toggle3 0x1)

Each crater scanned every cached and used LOS instance of every type
(ILosType::UpdateHeightMapSynced, 1.3% of the main thread in speed59's late
window). The batch deletes and queues the same instances; only the order of
queueing and deleting can differ, and the queue is drained whole into an
update whose map changes are integer sums.
